{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"musket","model_identifier":"musket","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## musket\n\nRanged weapon, gunpowder.\n\nPatch 5: `slot_muzzle` added at the muzzle end for the flash, sparks and smoke; nothing else changed.\n\n- Cubes: 11, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..1.5, y -3.2..2.8, z -44.5..10.0 (size 2.4 x 6.0 x 54.5 u = 7 x 17 x 153 cm).\nFlintlock musket, about 1.5 m (55 u): walnut-brown full stock with a deep butt, metal barrel with two barrel bands and a muzzle ring, ramrod under the barrel, lock plate on the right with a black flint in the cock and an upright frizzen, trigger guard. Grip (right hand at the wrist of the stock) at the origin; muzzle 44.5 u forward (-Z), butt plate 10 u back. Second grip (left hand under the fore-stock) 9.3 u forward (warrior_base musket_fire). Barrel/lock textures: iron grades, steel (steel barrel), high-quality steel.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n- Muzzle point for the game's flash: (0, 1.25, -44.5).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `musket_iron_bloom.png`, `musket_iron_wrought.png`, `musket_iron_refined.png`, `musket_steel.png`, `musket_hq_steel.png`\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_muzzle` at (0, 1.3, -44.5)"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"butt","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.9,-3.25,1],"to":[0.9,1,10],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,0,31.8,4.25],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[